<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tele Danmark.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tele Danmark.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs lowered its recommendation on Tele Danmark A/S to market perform from outperform, according to a Goldman Sachs source.</p>
<p>-- In early-session trading, the New York Stock Exchange-listed shares slipped 1/4 to 24.</p>
</text>
